# Personal documents. This repository is PUBLIC. A resume with a phone number
# and address lived untracked in the working tree for four days, one `git add
# -A` away from being pushed -- and `git add -A` did get run here once, sweeping
# in unrelated files that had to be unpicked with a soft reset. Keep personal
# documents out of the directory entirely; this is only the backstop.
